    <detaileddescription>
<para>A single versioned change event emitted by the temporal CDC subsystem.</para>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_change_event_1ad199339d22d8c545627f5a6df16ea13f" kindref="member">before_value</ref></computeroutput> is empty for INSERT events. <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_change_event_1a5385681de898046f34ad1b9710b28bbe" kindref="member">after_value</ref></computeroutput> is empty for DELETE events. <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_change_event_1a3fb10d95dceb8a218c2f94f6021abbfb" kindref="member">transaction_time</ref></computeroutput> records when the change was committed (system time). <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_change_event_1aa5a789d1381180cc9587e04eed9f2d70" kindref="member">valid_from</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_change_event_1a281eb2f9d2548a2859edeb4f566ac8a2" kindref="member">valid_to</ref></computeroutput> carry the application-time period when present. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
